@startuml
skinparam BackgroundColor White
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "User / Admin" as User
rectangle "External APIs" as ExtAPI

usecase "1.0\nProfile Fetching\n& Extraction" as P1
usecase "2.0\nModel Prediction\n& Risk Scoring" as P2
usecase "3.0\nReport\nGeneration" as P3
usecase "4.0\nModel Training\nPipeline" as P4
usecase "5.0\nHistory\nManagement" as P5

database "D1: USERS Table" as D1
database "D2: ANALYSIS_HISTORY" as D2
database "D3: MODEL_METADATA" as D3
database "FS1: .pkl Models" as FS1
database "FS2: .csv Datasets" as FS2

User --> P1 : Target Username
P1 <--> ExtAPI : HTTP Request/Response
P1 --> P2 : Extracted Features
P2 <--> FS1 : Load Best Model
P2 --> P5 : Prediction Result, Risk Score
P5 <--> D2 : Save / Retrieve
P5 --> P3 : History Data
P3 --> User : PDF Report
P2 --> User : Result Display

User --> P4 : Upload Dataset,\nTrigger Train
P4 <--> FS2 : Read Data
P4 --> FS1 : Save Trained Model
P4 --> D3 : Update Metrics

@enduml
